UPDATE companies SET description='Mid-Atlantic Steel Fabrication operates from Ronks, Pennsylvania, in the heart of Lancaster County. The company runs a full-service custom metal fabrication shop serving both homeowners and businesses across the Mid-Atlantic region and beyond.

The shop provides end-to-end fabrication capabilities including laser cutting, CNC forming, MIG and TIG welding, secondary machining such as countersinking, tapping and hardware insertion, and powder-coat finishing. Design support is offered through 3D CAD software, and the facility houses equipment from partners such as TRUMPF, HYDMECH, Ercolina and Miller. The company states it can handle one-off projects as well as high-volume production runs.

Mid-Atlantic Steel Fabrication emphasizes a one-stop-shop model with a dedicated project manager for each job, in-house secondary operations and certified welders holding AWS D1.1 structural credentials. The firm says its combination of advanced equipment, process expertise and proactive communication shortens lead times and controls costs.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Laser cutting", "CNC forming", "MIG welding", "TIG welding", "Countersinking", "Tapping", "Hardware insertion", "Powder coating", "3D CAD design", "Metal cutting"], "industries": [], "materials": ["Steel", "Iron", "Sheet metal"], "equipment": ["TRUMPF laser cutting systems", "HYDMECH equipment", "Ercolina equipment", "Miller welding equipment", "Fully automated laser cutting system", "Advanced bending and forming equipment"], "volume": "One-time projects to high-volume runs", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Dedicated project manager for each project", "In-house secondary machining (countersinking, tapping, hardware insertion)", "Powder-coat finishing available", "Design support with 3D CAD software", "Welders certified to AWS D1.1 structural standard"], "facts_used": ["Location: Ronks, Pennsylvania -> /", "Full-service custom metal fabrication shop -> /", "Services: laser cutting, CNC forming, MIG/TIG welding, secondary machining, powder coating, 3D CAD design -> /", "Equipment partners: TRUMPF, HYDMECH, Ercolina, Miller -> /", "Welders hold AWS D1.1 Structural Certification -> /", "Customers: contractors, manufacturers, business owners, homeowners -> /", "Shipping to most of North America -> /", "One-time projects and high-volume runs -> /", "Dedicated project manager per project -> /", "In-house secondary operations -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Mid-Atlantic Steel Fabrication is a full-service custom metal fabrication shop providing high-quality craftsmanship and superior customer service.", "found