UPDATE companies SET description='Montebello Plastics operates from Montebello, California. The company was founded in 2019 and is a small business; co‑founder Nado Husa is named on the leadership team. While the current entity dates to 2019, the team brings over four decades of experience in plastic film manufacturing.

The company manufactures polyethylene film products — custom poly bags, tubing, and sheeting — using high‑density (HDPE), low‑density (LDPE), and linear low‑density (LLDPE) resins. All items are made to order; no stock is kept. Production capabilities include custom sizing, thickness, color, and specialty additives such as PCR/reprocessed material, nano‑enhanced technology, and a bioremediation additive that breaks down to zero microplastics. The minimum order is typically one pallet (about 1,000 lbs).

Montebello Plastics serves industrial packaging, construction, agriculture, and the laundry/cleaners supply sector. Named customers include Laundry & Cleaners Supply, Inc., Continental Western Corporation, and AMZ Packaging, Inc. The company ships nationwide and offers local truck delivery in the Inland Empire, Orange County, Los Angeles, and the San Fernando Valley.

The company emphasizes that every product is 100% recyclable and meets California SB54 requirements. It highlights free shipping on U.S. orders over $50, a dedicated team that answers calls and emails same‑day, and a commitment to recycling all production scrap. FDA‑approved films are available for applicable applications.', certifications=ARRAY['FDA-APPROVED']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Polyethylene film extrusion", "Custom poly bag manufacturing", "Tubing production", "Sheeting production", "Custom sizing, thickness, and color", "FDA\u2011approved film production", "Post\u2011consumer recycled (PCR) / reprocessed material processing", "Specialty additives incorporation", "Nano\u2011enhanced technology for microplastic elimination", "Bioremediation additive for zero\u2011microplastic breakdown", "Scrap recycling in\u2011house"], "industries": ["Industrial packaging", "Construction", "Agriculture", "Laundry and cleaning supply", "Packaging"], "materials": ["High-density polyethylene (HDPE)", "Low-density polyethylene (LDPE)", "Linear low-density polyethylene (LLDPE)", "PCR & reprocessed material", "Specialty additives", "Nano\u2011enhanced technology resins", "Bioremediation additive resins"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Standard orders 2 weeks; small items up to 3 weeks", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Free shipping on U.S. orders over $50", "All products manufactured to order (no stock inventory)", "100% recyclable polyethylene films meeting California SB54", "Eco\u2011friendly options: nano\u2011enhanced and bioremediation technologies", "Local truck delivery in Southern California metro areas"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2019 -> db", "Headquarters Montebello, CA -> db", "Small business -> /about", "Co-founder Nado Husa -> /about", "40+ years team experience -> /", "Products: custom poly bags, tubing, sheeting -> /", "Materials: HDPE, LDPE, LLDPE, PCR, specialty additives -> /", "All products made to order, no stock -> /", "MOQ ~1 pallet