UPDATE companies SET description='More Than A Bakery operates from Versailles, Kentucky, as part of a family-owned contract manufacturing group with roots tracing back to 1855 in Richmond, Indiana. The business was founded in 1855 and has remained family-operated across generations, delivering food manufacturing solutions while fostering community ties.

