UPDATE companies SET description='Nebraska Prep Equipment is based in Adams, Nebraska. The company was founded in late 2017 by Cory Hart and Jamison Wallman. The pair had operated a catering business for five years and, while building a new kitchen, struggled to find quality used equipment locally. They began traveling to larger Midwestern cities to source reliable used pieces, transporting them back to southeast Nebraska, cleaning them, and reselling them to other food‑service operators in the area.

Today the business operates as a food‑service equipment dealer with a showroom on South 82nd Road in Adams. It sells both refurbished used equipment and new units backed by manufacturer warranties, along with occasional scratch‑and‑dent items at reduced prices. The showroom is open by appointment only, and the company emphasizes personal service throughout the buying process.

The customer base consists of locally owned restaurants, caterers, and hospitality businesses throughout the region.

